      "statement": "EmDash's virtual-module generator imports createPlugin from the entrypoint and calls it with empty options at runtime, so createPlugin must return a resolved plugin rather than a descriptor; it does so via definePlugin({ id, version, admin: { portableTextBlocks } }) using the same createBlockType.",
