      "statement": "The end-to-end data flow is: the admin Block Kit form captures fields keyed by action_id; ProseMirror stores plugin blocks as pluginBlock nodes with { blockType, id, data }; pmToPortableText spreads data back to top-level keys producing { _type: code-block-pro, _key, code, language, ... }; astro-portabletext passes the block as the node prop to CodeBlockPro.astro.",
